<section class="py-20 border-t border-gray-200/50 relative z-10 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
    <!-- Left Intro Block -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tertiary mb-3">Empowering Students</h2>
      <h3 class="text-heading-32 sm:text-heading-40 font-bold text-gray-1000 tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">
        Why anonymous support is vital.
      </h3>
      <p class="text-copy-15 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Traditional university counseling resources often have long wait times and high barriers to entry. Peerly bridges the gap by offering immediate, stigma-free access to support.
      </p>
      <div class="border-l-2 border-tertiary pl-4 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 italic">
        "Over 75% of students experiencing mental health struggles do not seek help early due to stigma or fear of academic consequences."
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Feature Cards Block -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-sm border border-gray-200 bg-background-200">
        <h4 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Eliminates Stigma</h4>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Students can discuss sensitive personal issues, academic pressure, and anxiety without worrying about labels, rumors, or disciplinary actions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-sm border border-gray-200 bg-background-200">
        <h4 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Lowers Help Barriers</h4>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Providing simple, text-based anonymous access encourages first-year students to reach out early, rather than waiting for a severe crisis.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-sm border border-gray-200 bg-background-200">
        <h4 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Increases Openness</h4>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Without the fear of personal identification, students express their true thoughts and concerns, allowing peer mentors to give highly relevant support.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-sm border border-gray-200 bg-background-200">
        <h4 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Builds Solid Trust</h4>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Students retain complete control over their participation. Anonymity establishes an immediate, secure environment of mutual respect.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
